==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|aɪə(r)}}
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/ˈæmpləfaɪə/}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/ˈæmpləfaɪɚ/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Anything that [[amplify|amplifies]], or makes something [[larger]] or more [[intense]].
# {{context|electronics}} An [[appliance]] or [[circuit]] that increases the [[strength]] of a weak [[electricity|electrical]] [[signal]] without changing the other characteristics of the signal.
# {{context|US|music}} An [[amp]], specifically a particular type of speaker used to amplify voices and musical instruments at live performances.<!--{{rfphoto}}?-->

